			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1ca5113 elementor-widget elementor-widget-litho-heading" data-id="1ca5113" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="litho-heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<span class="litho-heading elementor-size-default"><span class="horizontal-separator"></span><span class="litho-primary-title"><h1>About us</h1></span></span>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d073480 elementor-widget-tablet__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-litho-heading" data-id="d073480" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="litho-heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h5 class="litho-heading elementor-size-default"><span class="litho-primary-title">THE B. U. BHANDARI </span></h5>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b154aa8 elementor-widget-tablet__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="b154aa8" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>Our Automobile journey started way back in 1969, when Bajaj Tempo was our first mobility partner. The B. U. Bhandari group then welcomed Kinetic, Honda Motorcycles, Tata Motors, Fiat &amp; Mercedes Benz.</p><p>One showroom after the other, we became the leading authorised dealership in Pune of Volkswagen, MG Motors &amp; Triumph Motorcycles.</p><p>Many would think our aim is to sell. But we don’t just sell, we build. We drive innovation through mobility, sustainability through values and inspiration through legacy.</p><p>And that is why every mobility plying on the Indian roads has enabled us nurturing relationships, for when they think mobility, they think B. U. Bhandari.</p>						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
