				<div class="elementor-content-carousel swiper-wrapper">							<div class="elementor-repeater-item-4dee916 swiper-slide">
								<div class="feature-box-carousel-wrap">
									<div class="feature-carousel-box">
																					<div class="feature-box-carousel-content-wrap">
																									<div class="feature-box-digit">1920</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-title">THE BEGINNING</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-carousel-content"><p>Late Shri. Uttamchandji Tulsiramji Bhandari founded the group in 1920 and started trading in grains.</p></div>
																							</div>
																				</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="elementor-repeater-item-ef1f1ac swiper-slide">
								<div class="feature-box-carousel-wrap">
									<div class="feature-carousel-box">
																					<div class="feature-box-carousel-content-wrap">
																									<div class="feature-box-digit">1940</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-title">The Strive Forward</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-carousel-content"><p>Over a period of time, B. U. Bhandari and family expanded and diversified into sugar trading, distribution of Oil, Petrol Pumps, Automobile Dealerships, Developing Real Estates, Construction etc.</p></div>
																							</div>
																				</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="elementor-repeater-item-cb5a086 swiper-slide">
								<div class="feature-box-carousel-wrap">
									<div class="feature-carousel-box">
																					<div class="feature-box-carousel-content-wrap">
																									<div class="feature-box-digit">1969</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-title">The Automobiles</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-carousel-content"><p>B. U. Bhandari starts it endeavour of automobile dealerships with Bajaj Tempo in 1969 and goes on to be the dealers of Kinetic, Honda Motorcycles, Tata Motors, Fiat and Mercedes-Benz...</p></div>
																							</div>
																				</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="elementor-repeater-item-c47f822 swiper-slide">
								<div class="feature-box-carousel-wrap">
									<div class="feature-carousel-box">
																					<div class="feature-box-carousel-content-wrap">
																									<div class="feature-box-digit">1984</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-title">The Real Estate</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-carousel-content"><p>In the year 1984 the group started it's real estate and construction enterprise with B. U. Bhandari Landmarks and since then there has been no turning back.</p></div>
																							</div>
																				</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="elementor-repeater-item-0d78fdd swiper-slide">
								<div class="feature-box-carousel-wrap">
									<div class="feature-carousel-box">
																					<div class="feature-box-carousel-content-wrap">
																									<div class="feature-box-digit">2010</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-title">The Volkswagen</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-carousel-content"><p>The year 2010 was a year to celebrate as B. U. Bhandari began operations of internationally acclaimed auto dealership of Volkswagen Group Sales India Pvt. Ltd.</p></div>
																							</div>
																				</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="elementor-repeater-item-8f3e946 swiper-slide">
								<div class="feature-box-carousel-wrap">
									<div class="feature-carousel-box">
																					<div class="feature-box-carousel-content-wrap">
																									<div class="feature-box-digit">2014</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-title">The Triumph</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-carousel-content"><p>We became the official dealers of Triumph Motorcycles India Pvt Ltd in 2014 handling the regions of Maharashtra &amp; Goa.</p></div>
																							</div>
																				</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="elementor-repeater-item-f09cc6e swiper-slide">
								<div class="feature-box-carousel-wrap">
									<div class="feature-carousel-box">
																					<div class="feature-box-carousel-content-wrap">
																									<div class="feature-box-digit">2014</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-title">The Responsibility</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-carousel-content"><p>We ventured into solar energy and we established B. U. Bhandari Energy Pvt. Ltd., a Solar EPC Company</p></div>
																							</div>
																				</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="elementor-repeater-item-2374beb swiper-slide">
								<div class="feature-box-carousel-wrap">
									<div class="feature-carousel-box">
																					<div class="feature-box-carousel-content-wrap">
																									<div class="feature-box-digit">2015</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-title">The Responsibility</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-carousel-content"><p>We were awarded as the <strong>"Sarvottam Dealer" </strong>in the year 2015 and the prestigious <strong>"Diamond Pin"</strong>, which recognizes the top 60 Volkswagen dealerships around the globe in 2016.</p></div>
																							</div>
																				</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="elementor-repeater-item-461bc93 swiper-slide">
								<div class="feature-box-carousel-wrap">
									<div class="feature-carousel-box">
																					<div class="feature-box-carousel-content-wrap">
																									<div class="feature-box-digit">2019</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-title">THE MG</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-carousel-content"><div class="timeline-panel"><div class="timeline-body"><p>B. U. Bhandari becomes the dealer for Morris Garages.Morris Garages with facilities at Wakad, Camp, Bramati &amp; Hadapsar in Pune</p></div></div><div class="timeline-badge"> </div></div>
																							</div>
																				</div>
								</div>
							</div>
													<div class="elementor-repeater-item-28cf3e4 swiper-slide">
								<div class="feature-box-carousel-wrap">
									<div class="feature-carousel-box">
																					<div class="feature-box-carousel-content-wrap">
																									<div class="feature-box-digit">2020</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-title">THE LEGACY</div>
																									<div class="feature-box-carousel-content"><div class="timeline-panel"><div class="timeline-body"><section class="our-history gray-bg page-section-ptb"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><div class="timeline-panel"><div class="timeline-body"><p>B. U. Bhandari completes a glorious 100 years in 2020.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="play-video white-bg page-section-ptb"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><div class="section-title"> </div></div></div></div></section></div></div></div>
																							</div>
																				</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
